+--[[
+	Covers the behavior PlacementRules documents: snap, and each acceptance rule of validate.
+
+	The specs test only the public contract. They don't spy on internal calls, test the private
+	_isFinite helper, or check exact reason strings, because the docs only promise "a short
+	reason". Each rejection case changes one input from a request that is known to pass, so the
+	rejection can only come from the rule under test.
+
+	Distances and heights come from BlockTypes.BlockSize, PlacementRules.MaxHeight and
+	PlacementRules.MaxReach, so retuning those values doesn't break the specs.
+]]
